{"thread":{"threadID":4640,"boardID":121,"topic":"SG5","time":1500647713,"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","lastPostTime":1502412111,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":7,"views":97,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":3},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":69120,"threadID":4640,"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","subject":"SG5","time":1500647713,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1500647897,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1500649185,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1500654351,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>So, ich höre von allen Admins verschiedenes.<br>Ihr kennt die Map SG5 auf TTT, dort kann man an einigen Stellen in Fenster hinenklettern. Viele sagen es ist so gewollt, andere sagen es ist Buguse. Ich hätte gerne eine endgültige Antwort nach der wir uns richten können.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hier Screenshots von einem Raum (Aus diesem kommt man nicht mehr hinaus sobald man drinne ist<br><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1084696158\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1084695974\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Dies ist der andere Raum<br><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1084695162\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1084695368\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1084695584\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Aus beiden Räumen kann man hinaus schauen jedoch nicht herein.<br>Es gibt noch weitere Räume auf dieser Map.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Außerdem sollte meiner Meinung nach diese Map komplett entfernt werden da es meines Wissens nach nur 5 Primary Weapons und 3 Secondary Weapons auf dieser Map sich befinden. Zudem kann man am Spawn direkt Bugusen mit einem Auto.<br>-&gt; Kleine Map<br>-&gt; Kaum Waffen<br>-&gt; Dunkel<br>-&gt; Viele Stellen zum Bugusen</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Liebe Grüße Unicorn</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":69121,"threadID":4640,"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","subject":"","time":1500647913,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1500649193,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1500654340,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich bin auch eher für das Entfernen der Map.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":69125,"threadID":4640,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":1500649766,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1500650164,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1500651829,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1500654355,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich bin auch dafür für das entfernen der Map.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":69128,"threadID":4640,"userID":2378,"username":"Verdia","subject":"","time":1500653473,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1500654262,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1500654357,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1500655011,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich bin eher für das Entfernen der Map.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":69129,"threadID":4640,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1500655967,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","